<title>USA: Paul Harris Stores December same store up.</title>
<headline>Paul Harris Stores December same store up.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paul Harris Stores Inc said Thursday comparable-store sales rose 23 percent in December from a year ago.  </p>
<p>Net sales for the month rose to $39.9 million from $34.4 million a year ago, the women's apparel specialty retailer said.</p>
<p>Year-to-date comparable store sales were up 19 percent, with net sales of $182.6 million, up from $160.0 million a year ago, with a base of nine percent fewer stores, Paul Harris said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
